data: {"messages":[{"content":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"23590f17-b784-4f48-a10a-1ae18d904b6d"}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/d80a9210-040b-42ab-bf8c-5c01581e54c4/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/d80a9210-040b-42ab-bf8c-5c01581e54c4/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/d80a9210-040b-42ab-bf8c-5c01581e54c4/user-data/outputs"},"artifacts":[],"raw_messages":[],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","normalized_query":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警为重复事件，并保留合并依据","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这批摄像头","监控目标":"相似告警、重复事件","输出形式":"合并依据"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_2cbb50","text":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_538fa7","text":"接入并解析该批次摄像头的原始告警数据源，提取时间戳、设备位置标识、识别目标类别与置信度、证据文件路径等核心字段，完成数据清洗与格式对齐，输出标准化告警明细数据集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_fcff8b","text":"基于标准化数据集，按预设时间容差与空间邻近阈值进行候选集过滤，调用多模态特征比对能力计算告警对之间的证据画面重合度与语义匹配分，输出相似度量化排序列表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_dee4cc","text":"依据设定的相似度阈值与图连通性合并规则，将高关联告警聚合为独立事件簇，按优先级策略（如时间最早或证据完整性最高）锁定簇内主记录，输出去重后的事件分组映射表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a479d5","text":"遍历已合并的事件簇，逐项提取并固化合并判定的关键指标快照（含时间跨度、空间偏差、目标一致性指标及参考证据索引），组装带完整溯源链条的合并结果清单，准备交付。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_5e0a12","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警为重复事件，并保留合并依据。","params":{"视频对象":"这批摄像头","监控目标":"相似告警、重复事件","输出形式":"合并依据"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_5e0a12","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警为重复事件，并保留合并依据。","params":{"视频对象":"这批摄像头","监控目标":"相似告警、重复事件","输出形式":"合并依据"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:23590f17-b784-4f48-a10a-1ae18d904b6d"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}}}

event: values
data: {"messages":[{"content":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"23590f17-b784-4f48-a10a-1ae18d904b6d"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): video_surveillance. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"61fc3f22-26fd-4794-97e9-b39c0230a413"}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/d80a9210-040b-42ab-bf8c-5c01581e54c4/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/d80a9210-040b-42ab-bf8c-5c01581e54c4/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/d80a9210-040b-42ab-bf8c-5c01581e54c4/user-data/outputs"},"artifacts":[],"raw_messages":[],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","normalized_query":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警为重复事件，并保留合并依据","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这批摄像头","监控目标":"相似告警、重复事件","输出形式":"合并依据"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_2cbb50","text":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_538fa7","text":"接入并解析该批次摄像头的原始告警数据源，提取时间戳、设备位置标识、识别目标类别与置信度、证据文件路径等核心字段，完成数据清洗与格式对齐，输出标准化告警明细数据集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_fcff8b","text":"基于标准化数据集，按预设时间容差与空间邻近阈值进行候选集过滤，调用多模态特征比对能力计算告警对之间的证据画面重合度与语义匹配分，输出相似度量化排序列表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_dee4cc","text":"依据设定的相似度阈值与图连通性合并规则，将高关联告警聚合为独立事件簇，按优先级策略（如时间最早或证据完整性最高）锁定簇内主记录，输出去重后的事件分组映射表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a479d5","text":"遍历已合并的事件簇，逐项提取并固化合并判定的关键指标快照（含时间跨度、空间偏差、目标一致性指标及参考证据索引），组装带完整溯源链条的合并结果清单，准备交付。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_5e0a12","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警为重复事件，并保留合并依据。","params":{"视频对象":"这批摄像头","监控目标":"相似告警、重复事件","输出形式":"合并依据"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_5e0a12","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警为重复事件，并保留合并依据。","params":{"视频对象":"这批摄像头","监控目标":"相似告警、重复事件","输出形式":"合并依据"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:23590f17-b784-4f48-a10a-1ae18d904b6d"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":false,"primary_goal":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":[],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":0.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":[],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:23590f17-b784-4f48-a10a-1ae18d904b6d"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":[],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

